              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 7:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " MUKAMA yaabaha okuhuumura embaju zoona, nk'oku yaaraganiise baishenkurubo; omu bazigu baabo boona tihariho n'omwe owaayehangire kubaza omu kaso; kureka MUKAMA akabahayo boona omu mikono yaabo. ",
          "type": "text",
